Notes on deferred-but-now-flagged work
======================================
Things still flagged after this push:
- Picker UX for default_modality_id needs ListModalities RPC on
  clinical-svc to land first. ~20min backend work.
- Picker UX for organization_id transfer in UserEdit could use a
  paginated org search, but AdminListOrganizations already exists;
  this is a frontend-only enhancement (typeahead).
- Primary-admin picker only sees therapists for the org. To pick a
  non-therapist user as primary admin, an admin must first promote
  the user via UserEdit. This is documented in the hint text.

